<title>UK: London Brady bond market shut till Friday.</title>
<headline>London Brady bond market shut till Friday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brady bond market will be shut in London for the Christmas break on Wednesday, December 25 and Thursday, December 26. The market will reopen on Friday, December 27. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 2734</p>
